steps:
Create freelance_automation/ai_responder.py: AIResponder class. Method: generate_response(session, order: Order, platform: str, portfolio_items: list[str]) -> str. Builds prompt: 'Analyze this job posting: {order.title}
{order.description}
Budget: {order.budget}
Platform: {platform}
Relevant portfolio: {portfolio_items}
Generate a unique, professional response in Russian. Adapt tone for {platform} (kwork=concise/professional, fl.ru=detailed/friendly). Include relevant portfolio mention. Max 500 chars.' Uses ai_router.call_llm_text(session, prompt, max_output_tokens=300, temperature=0.7). Falls back to generic template if LLM fails.
